    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been having these really bad muscle cramps in my legs lately and i'm feeling super wiped out all the time. i looked it up and i think my potassium might be low. i have stage 3 chronic kidney disease so my doctor told me to be careful with stuff, but would it be okay if i just started taking some 99mg potassium supplements a few times a day to see if it helps the cramps? i just want to feel better without having to wait weeks for my next kidney appointment.",
